</div>
<div id="algx1.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l27.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">27:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="algx1.l27.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="algx1.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{N}|&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{N}|&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx1.l27.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l28" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l28.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">28:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx1.l28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(n_{i},n_{j})\leftarrow\mathop{\arg\max}_{n_{a},n_{b}\in\mathcal{N}}\text{sim}(\mathbf{p}_{a}^{\text{f}},\mathbf{p}_{b}^{\text{f}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>a</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>b</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(n_{i},n_{j})\leftarrow\mathop{\arg\max}_{n_{a},n_{b}\in\mathcal{N}}\text{sim}(\mathbf{p}_{a}^{\text{f}},\mathbf{p}_{b}^{\text{f}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx1.l28.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l28.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Find most similar pair using Eq. (<a href="#S3.E8" title="Equation 8 ‣ Hierarchical Construction. ‣ 3.2 Our Method: Semantic-guided Adaptive Expert Forest ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ From Isolation to Integration: Building an Adaptive Expert Forest for Pre-Trained Model-based Class-Incremental Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l29" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l29.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">29:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx1.l29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{p}\leftarrow\text{sign}(\theta_{i}+\theta_{j})\odot\max(|\theta_{i}|,|\theta_{j}|)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>sign</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{p}\leftarrow\text{sign}(\theta_{i}+\theta_{j})\odot\max(|\theta_{i}|,|\theta_{j}|)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx1.l29.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l29.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Merge parameters using Eq. (<a href="#S3.E9" title="Equation 9 ‣ Hierarchical Construction. ‣ 3.2 Our Method: Semantic-guided Adaptive Expert Forest ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ From Isolation to Integration: Building an Adaptive Expert Forest for Pre-Trained Model-based Class-Incremental Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l30" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l30.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">30:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx1.l30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{p}^{\text{f}}\leftarrow\text{WeightedAvgMerge}(\mathbf{p}_{i}^{\text{f}},\mathbf{p}_{j}^{\text{f}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>WeightedAvgMerge</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{p}^{\text{f}}\leftarrow\text{WeightedAvgMerge}(\mathbf{p}_{i}^{\text{f}},\mathbf{p}_{j}^{\text{f}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx1.l30.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx1.l30.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Merge prototypes, see Appx. <a href="#A1.SS1" title="A.1 Hierarchical Construction Details ‣ Appendix A Detailed Implementation of SAEF Operations ‣ From Isolation to Integration: Building an Adaptive Expert Forest for Pre-Trained Model-based Class-Incremental Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l31" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l31.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">31:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx1.l31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{p}\leftarrow\text{NewNode}(\mathcal{A}_{p}(\theta_{p}),\mathbf{p}_{p}^{\text{f}},\text{children}=(n_{i},n_{j}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>NewNode</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext>f</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><mtext>children</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{p}\leftarrow\text{NewNode}(\mathcal{A}_{p}(\theta_{p}),\mathbf{p}_{p}^{\text{f}},\text{children}=(n_{i},n_{j}))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx1.l32" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l32.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">32:</span></span>
            
            
             Remove <math id="algx1.l32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{i},n_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{i},n_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="algx1.l32.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}</annotation></semantics></math>; Add <math id="algx1.l32.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{p}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="algx1.l32.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}</annotation></semantics></math>
  
</div>
<div id="algx1.l33" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx1.l33.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">33:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="algx1.l33.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> The single remaining node in <math id="algx1.l33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}</annotation></semantics></math> (the tree root)

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> SAEF: Online Adaptive Inference</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algx2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="algx2.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inputs:</span>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
           Test sample <math id="algx2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
           The pre-built ‘Hierarchy‘<math id="algx2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=(\mathcal{R},R_{G})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=(\mathcal{R},R_{G})</annotation></semantics></math> from Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Detailed Implementation of SAEF Operations ‣ From Isolation to Integration: Building an Adaptive Expert Forest for Pre-Trained Model-based Class-Incremental Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
           Frozen feature extractor <math id="algx2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϕ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi</annotation></semantics></math>, Classifier <math id="algx2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{T}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
           Fusion temperature <math id="algx2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, Entropy threshold <math id="algx2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{e}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="algx2.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> The final predicted class label <math id="algx2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{pred}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{pred}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="algx2.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="algx2.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Inference</span>(<math id="algx2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x,(\mathcal{R},R_{G}),\phi,W_{T},\tau,\tau_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x,(\mathcal{R},R_{G}),\phi,W_{T},\tau,\tau_{e}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="algx2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="algx2.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> — <span id="algx2.l8.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 3: Adaptive Inference</span> —
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
            Initialize activated expert set: <math id="algx2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}\leftarrow\{R_{G}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>G</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}\leftarrow\{R_{G}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx2.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx2.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Start with the Global Expert
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="algx2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each tree root <math id="algx2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{k}\in\mathcal{R}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{k}\in\mathcal{R}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx2.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{k}\leftarrow\text{FindPath}(R_{k},x,\phi,W_{T},\tau_{e})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>FindPath</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{k}\leftarrow\text{FindPath}(R_{k},x,\phi,W_{T},\tau_{e})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx2.l11.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx2.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Find low-entropy path in each tree
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
             <math id="algx2.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}\cup\mathcal{P}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}\cup\mathcal{P}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx2.l12.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="algx2.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Collect all experts on the paths, Eq. (<a href="#S3.E13" title="Equation 13 ‣ Adaptive Inference. ‣ 3.2 Our Method: Semantic-guided Adaptive Expert Forest ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ From Isolation to Integration: Building an Adaptive Expert Forest for Pre-Trained Model-based Class-Incremental Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>)
  </span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
            Initialize results list: <math id="algx2.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\leftarrow[]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\leftarrow[]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="algx2.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each expert <math id="algx2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n\in\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n\in\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algx2.l14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="algx2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algx2.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
